     "titulo": "Laisser + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Laisser** + infinitive means «to let»: **Je laisse Thomas parler** (I let Thomas speak).",
      "The subject of the infinitive goes after the verb **laisser**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
